62
00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:21.470
I love to share where I am with people and it is cathartic

63
00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:22.530
and healing for me.

64
00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.980
And at the same time, I do feel this huge sense

65
00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:30.740
