70
00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.840
There's so much misinformation.

71
00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.550
There's so much fear mongering.

72
00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.650
And that hasn't changed,

73
00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:48.680
