74
00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.450
And that fear of not knowing how to find myself,

75
00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.590
not knowing who I was,

76
00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.189
thinking that there was something wrong with me.

77
00:02:54.189 --> 00:02:55.960
From my earliest ages,

78
00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.230
some of the times I remember being bullied as a little kid,

79
00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:00.417
I remember thinking, "If I could ever do something

80
00:03:00.417 --> 00:03:01.250
"that could make it

81
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.307
